{"translation":{"id":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤛᤱ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"WBT","englishName":"Limbu NT (Limbu Script)","language":"lif","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6116919e88a76086a83bb2f30e555928fb0b93d877561f10c5d7384878062fd6","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7875,"languageName":"Limbu","languageEnglishName":"Limbu"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤜᤡᤒᤪᤢ","commonName":"ᤜᤡᤒᤪᤢ","title":"ᤜᤡᤒᤪᤢᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤗᤠᤃᤡ ᤛᤰᤀᤡᤱᤄᤱ","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"414f797cf01c4bdaa3690389f15c08c4542c823e36806579e381b5579d5320b8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":297},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ᤛᤠᤱᤃᤪᤠᤶᤐᤣᤍᤠᤱ ᤏᤢ ᤀᤡᤰᤛᤠᤀᤥᤒᤠ ᤛᤣᤘᤠ ᤆᤥ᤺ᤰᤔᤠᤴ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ᤀᤠᤸᤗ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱ ᤏᤢ ᤀᤡᤛᤪᤠᤀᤡᤗᤡᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤂᤢᤏᤡ᤹ ᤗᤢᤶᤔᤥ ᤌᤡᤰᤛᤡᤃᤣ᤺ᤰᤛ᤻ᤔᤠ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵᤐᤥ ᤛᤣᤘᤠ ᤆᤥ᤺ᤰᤔᤠ ᤌᤡᤶᤜᤠ᤹ ᤘᤕᤧ. ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤀᤡᤰᤛᤠᤀᤥ ᤛᤣᤛᤣᤒᤠ ᤋᤧᤴᤏᤠᤱ ᤏᤧᤛ᤻ᤛᤧᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ᤂᤧᤴ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤛᤠ᤺ᤱᤃᤠᤜᤡᤶᤔᤥ ᤏᤧᤳᤇᤡ ᤕᤠᤰᤑᤠ ᤏᤧᤛ᤻ᤛᤧ॥ ᤂᤧᤵᤔᤥ ᤌᤡᤰᤛᤡᤃᤣ᤺ᤰᤛ᤻ᤔᤠ ᤕᤠᤰᤑᤠᤀᤥ ᤛᤣᤔᤡ ᤕᤢᤱᤍᤧᤴ. ᤆᤵᤋᤧᤴ ᤏᤢ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤅᤥ ᤋᤥ᤺ᤶᤔᤏᤠᤒᤠ ᤛᤣᤛᤣ ᤂᤖᤧ᤺ᤱᤜᤠ᤹ ᤏᤧᤛ᤻ᤛᤧ॥ ᤁᤴ ᤋᤧᤴᤏᤡᤴ ᤛᤣᤛᤣᤒᤠ ᤋᤧᤴ ᤔᤧᤔᤧᤳᤋᤢᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤂᤧᤵᤔᤥ ᤑᤥ᤺ᤴᤍᤠᤎᤡᤰ ᤐᤳᤇᤧ॥ ᤂᤧᤴ ᤑᤥ᤺ᤴᤍᤠ᤺ᤸᤗᤧ ᤌᤣ᤺ᤰᤋᤢᤒᤠ ᤏᤡᤛᤡᤃᤣ᤺ᤰᤐᤠ ᤕᤠᤰᤑᤠ᤺ᤴ ᤁᤠᤰᤏᤢ᤺ᤸᤗᤧ ᤛᤣᤛᤣᤒᤠ ᤋᤧᤴ ᤔᤧᤔᤧᤳᤋᤢᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["ᤂᤧᤵᤔᤥ ᤛᤠᤶᤔᤩᤠᤱ ᤛᤠᤱᤛᤡᤱ ᤜᤠ᤺ᤶᤔᤠᤍᤧᤴᤎᤡᤰ ᤏᤢ ᤛᤠᤶᤔᤩᤠᤱᤅᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤛᤢ᤺ᤵᤔᤏᤠᤒᤠ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵᤐᤡᤸᤗᤧᤴ ᤛᤴᤍᤥ᤺ᤰᤁᤡᤴ ᤕᤢᤅᤧ॥ ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤂᤧᤴ ᤛᤴᤍᤥ᤺ᤰ ᤛᤡᤃᤠᤱ ᤔᤴᤏᤠ",{"noteId":26},"ᤁᤧᤕᤠᤰᤐᤠ ᤛᤠᤶᤔᤩᤠᤱ ᤂᤵᤐᤩᤠ᤺ᤴ. ᤁᤢᤑᤧᤰᤔᤣ᤺ᤳ ᤁᤧᤒᤵᤐᤠ ᤜᤠᤖᤢᤏᤖᤧ ᤁᤢᤍᤰᤁᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤡᤴ ᤏᤢ ᤌᤡᤒᤥ᤺ᤱ ᤛᤠᤶᤕᤥ ᤀᤡᤱᤈᤠ᤺ᤱ ᤁᤧᤒᤵᤐᤠ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵᤐᤡᤸᤗᤧᤴ ᤗᤢᤱᤛᤠᤵᤜᤠ᤹ ᤕᤠᤃᤧᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["ᤂᤧᤴ ᤛᤴᤍᤥ᤺ᤰ ᤛᤶᤍᤠᤱ ᤁᤖᤢᤒ ᤔᤧᤵᤔᤏᤠᤒᤠ